cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its framework in academic work, please cite it."
title: "XLeRobot Household Service Robot"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A framework and standalone safety-gated runtime for a dual-arm, three-wheel
  omnidirectional household service robot. It provides RGB observation
  evidence, catalog-constrained task selection, one-time authorization,
  bounded mobile-manipulation missions with recovery, RGB table-edge docking,
  and Jetson TensorRT inference tooling for SmolVLA and pi0.5.
authors:
  - name: "XLeRobot contributors"
keywords:
  - robotics
  - embodied-ai
  - vision-language-action
  - smolvla
  - tensorrt
  - jetson
  - lerobot
